# rudderstack_destination_http_v2 (Resource)

Configure the HTTP v2 destination with a JSONata request body template over `$$.events`, optional message-type filtering, and batches of up to 5,000 events. Verify the template and request-field expressions before saving. The existing `rudderstack_destination_http` resource remains on version 1.

For more information, see https://www.rudderstack.com/docs/destinations/streaming-destinations/http/.

